Package: khad-media-player
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Khad Media Player contributors <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, mpv, yt-dlp
Recommends: gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0
Homepage: https://github.com/oibitoye/khad-player
Description: Cross-platform GTK media player powered by mpv
 Khad Media Player is a GTK 3 frontend for media and IPTV playback
 using mpv and optional yt-dlp search.
 .
 This package installs the Python application and desktop entry.
 System packages provide GTK, mpv and yt-dlp.
 .
 Preview build — see docs/KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md. Licence file pending.
